Subject: [PATCH] [daveey] Memoize capability refresh deadlines on quiet
 dispatcher ticks

G2b partial implementation: retain the registry-derived due clock behind config and file signatures, preserving external replacement, clock rollback, failed refresh retries and single-flight. RED: three redundant-read assertions fail on base. GREEN: 47 passed, one skipped across capability refresh and routing files. Remaining G2b supervisor/wake-check gates, drain replay, mutation coverage, independent review, CI and live P1 acceptance are not yet implemented or claimed.
